  "pubInvite": "Key created ✓\n\nLast connection: the key must be allowed to publish in **your** Play Console.\n1. Press **Open Play Console** below\n2. Copy the address of the page you see (any page) and **paste it here in the chat**\n\nThen the PC browser opens once: sign in with the same Google account and press **Allow**. I send the invitation myself.",
